<title>FINLAND: Finnish August export prices fall 1.2 pct mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Finnish August export prices fall 1.2 pct mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices fell 1.2 percent in August from July and fell 1.5 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			August 1996	  July 1996   August 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     -1.2 pct	    -1.4 pct	+0.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 -1.5 pct	    -0.3 pct	+6.0 pct</p>
<p>Markka-denominated import prices fell 0.7 percent month-on-month in August but they rose 1.5 percent year-on-year, SF said.</p>
<p>			August 1996	  July 1996   August 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     -0.7 pct	    +0.1 pct	0.0 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 +1.5 pct	    +2.2 pct     -0.8 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
